[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_9900","text":"雏菜的父亲"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0010","text":"那么，大家\n路上小心，去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0020","text":"好、好的！\n我们出门了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0030","text":"哇，已经在响了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0040","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0050","text":"──啊……对、对了\n大家，要怎么办……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0060","text":"嗯～……\n啊，是那种偶像运动会之类的～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0070","text":"对、对……\n就是电视上那个……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0080","text":"嗯……\n想上的人～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0090","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0100","text":"那，不就行了\n就不去了呗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0110","text":"嗯／嗯、嗯……！／嗯～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0120","text":"糟了……\n得跳才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0130","text":"嘿～\n什么什么～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0140","text":"说是要在０点０分00000秒的时候\n跳起来……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0150","text":"然后会怎样～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0160","text":"会有特别的感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0170","text":"啊哈～！\n那雏菜也要跳～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0180","text":"糟了糟了\n还有10秒"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0190","text":"跳吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_02_0200","text":"──────"}]
